comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T16:01:39.789Z",codex-sol,"Required checks verified: test (22), test (26), codeql. CodeQL remains unfiltered. Existing open CI item concerns release publishing and belongs to release work; no existing quick/deep or flaky-test item found, so create this Task. Preserve pinned action revisions and all release gates; docs path includes identity, changelog, package documentation and the release-caller docs contract. No release verifier or caller edits."
  "2026-11-15T16:04:17.357Z",codex-sol,"Baseline main run 43653414648: Node 26 execution 45m54s, Node 22 28m26s; creation-to-completion 114m25s and 154m31s. Largest full suites: schema boundaries 693.43s, transfers 160.63s, bindings 134.50s, mutation law 94.72s. Required CodeQL stays unfiltered. Typecheck and lint pass through pm test; helper tests and strict YAML parse pass. All product timeoutMs/budget and record-size assertions stay unscaled. Seeded batches use partial final batches with generated counts. Quick touched suites are running after a successful build. No full local test run."
  "2026-11-15T16:06:51.088Z",codex-sol,PR #58 published at aca9955. Required-check CI run 43733458055 is queued; no PR wall-time measurement. Strict tracker health passes with zero warnings. Quick document model passes 103 cases with 7 refusals and all four mutation outcomes (41.07s); coalesced model 50 cases passes (30.96s); bindings 50 passes (28.98s); fragment SDK 50 passes (1.74s). Remaining schema/mutation tests are running. One quick coverage attempt has now started with a 20-minute limit because the initial quick measurements look feasible. Full consumer installation acceptance stays in PR CI; local helper tests verify its only timeout change.
  "2026-11-15T16:23:11.442Z",codex-sol,"Final validation: quick coverage exits zero, 212/212 tests passed, all 24 configured source files measured, statements/branches/functions/lines all 100%, unchanged thresholds and scope. Test phase 905.12s (15m05s) on local Node 24.19.0. Selected changed suites pass 19/19 in 242.02s; helper tests 2/2; typecheck, lint, YAML and strict health pass with zero warnings. Original schema boundary sample 29 cases includes 12 accepted and 17 refused; mutation model produces 94 successes and 106 refusals. Final input audit adds existing publish-attestation verification to the docs path because it checks shebangs in every tracked file; verifier scripts remain unchanged. Required CodeQL remains unfiltered. Four full consumer journeys stay for PR CI, not rerun locally; no full-depth local suite. Required-check CI observed queued at run 43733458055, so new PR wall time is unavailable. Item released, left in_progress. Risks: pending exact-head Node 22/26 installation and CI, and unmeasured full deep duration."
  "2026-11-15T16:24:27.644Z",codex-sol,Final changelog check correctly found the newly committed in-progress Task missing from the generated Unreleased section. Regenerate the canonical changelog and verify it before the final push. Quick coverage remains passing at 212/212 and 100/100/100/100; no product or verifier implementation changes. The latest observed required-check run 43735209949 is queued; the changelog receipt push supersedes it.
  "2026-11-16T08:24:20.540Z",codex-sol,"Batch 2 template follow-up: split deep validation into Node 22/26 x npm/Bun with one conditional full release gate per job; preserve runner selection and full depth/time scale; disable deep cancellation; extend executable tracker/docs routing. Required CodeQL check remains unfiltered. Existing hosted-only npm cache restoration and Bun installation plus version logging already conform. Release callers, sync workflows, verifier scripts, protection and variables stay unchanged."
  "2026-11-16T08:28:58.019Z",codex-sol,"Latest successful PR run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-evidence/actions/runs/43735328882: Node 22/26 execution 2m28s/5m56s; created-to-completed including queue 45m57s/31m27s. Both executions fit the approximately 15-minute target, so item 6 needs no quick-depth or sharding change. Items 1, 2 and 5 changed; item 3 exempt because CodeQL is required; item 4 already conforms. Added strict unique-key YAML, one-gate matrix, runner setup and executable-path behavioral contracts."
  "2026-11-16T08:29:18.554Z",codex-sol,"Final local proof passed through pm test --run --only-last --progress: strict unique-key YAML parsing of every workflow, workflow contracts, npm run typecheck and npm run lint. actionlint is unavailable. Initial helper annotation/build setup issues were corrected before the passing rerun. No full-depth run attempted locally; deep certification remains after merge. PR observation is bounded to 30 minutes after the final push."
  "2026-11-16T08:40:38.659Z",codex-sol,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-evidence/pull/60, implementation head 4b9ce681890864ff06bc990ae559d2cb9d183752: all required checks passed. codeql: execution 0m54s, created-to-completed 0m57s; test (22): execution 3m56s, created-to-completed 3m57s; test (26): execution 8m56s, created-to-completed 9m31s. Job API timestamps include queue in wall time. Slowest logged tests: git npm and npx evidence journey 86.19s; packed npm and npx evidence journey 83.07s; selected schema boundaries follow the complete-record write/read law 74.19s; packed bun and bunx evidence journey 56.04s; git bun and bunx evidence journey 54.37s. Local workflow contracts, strict YAML, typecheck, lint and committed identity/private-path gates passed. Full-depth certification remains after merge. Final tracker-only receipt will be pushed with claim released; final-head CI is recorded in the PR body during the bounded watch."
